target = join(cacheRoot, checksum) (extensions.ts:171), cacheRoot comes from EXTENSION_CACHE_ROOT=/extensions (docker-compose.coolify.yml:146) with `extension_cache:/extensions` named volume (docker-compose.coolify.yml:151, volume declared at :541). /tmp is on the container overlay, /extensions is a separate mount point → rename(2) returns EXDEV across mount boundaries (true even when the underlying device is the same), and Node's fs.rename has no copy fallback. The catch fallback calls packageRoot(target) on a target that was never populated, so it rethrows the original EXDEV.
